ents to guide the choices of Verita Retro, the protagonist.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/staffer-retro", "videos": [{"id": 156455, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "2hrMnQPkltM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2hrMnQPkltM", "title": "[Staffer Retro : A Supernatural Mystery Quest] Trailer (EN)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2hrMnQPkltM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}